Teknologi
Saya rekomendasikan:

Next.js + React â†’ aplikasi
Tailwind + shadcn/ui â†’ UI
MapLibre/Leaflet â†’ GIS
Recharts â†’ grafik
FastAPI â†’ backend
PostgreSQL + PostGIS â†’ database GIS
Python â†’ machine learning
ANFIS â†’ model kondisi trafo
Cara kita mengerjakannya di Antigravity
Saya sarankan jangan memberikan satu prompt raksasa.

Karena Antigravity mendukung agent, browser verification, artifacts, dan pekerjaan multi-step, lebih baik kita pecah menjadi beberapa task yang bisa diverifikasi satu per satu. 

PROMPT 1 â€” Buat fondasi aplikasi
Copy ke Antigravity:

Create a new full-stack web application called:

BDIS â€” Bengkayang Distribution Intelligence System

Purpose:
A modern AI + GIS dashboard prototype for PLN ULP Bengkayang to monitor transformer assets, reliability and transformer condition.

Build the project using:

Frontend:
- Next.js
- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui

GIS:
- MapLibre GL JS or Leaflet

Charts:
- Recharts

Backend:
- FastAPI
- Python

Database preparation:
- PostgreSQL
- PostGIS

Machine learning preparation:
- Python ANFIS service interface

For the first milestone, focus ONLY on the frontend prototype.

Create:

1. Landing page
2. Executive dashboard
3. GIS asset page
4. AI transformer analysis page
5. Reliability page
6. Maintenance priority page
7. Data page

Use a professional dark industrial technology design.

Brand:
BDIS

Subtitle:
Bengkayang Distribution Intelligence System

Tagline:
AI-powered asset & reliability intelligence

Target users:
PLN ULP Bengkayang.

Do NOT use real PLN confidential data.
Use clearly labeled DEMO DATA.

Center the GIS around Bengkayang, West Kalimantan.

Before finishing:
- Run the application.
- Open it in the browser.
- Test every route.
- Check responsive layout.
- Fix console errors.
- Produce screenshots/artifacts showing the working UI.
PROMPT 2 â€” GIS
Setelah prompt pertama selesai:

Now implement the GIS Asset Intelligence module.

Create a realistic interactive map centered around Bengkayang, West Kalimantan.

Create demo transformer assets with:
- asset ID
- transformer name
- feeder
- capacity
- latitude
- longitude
- loading
- temperature
- power factor
- outage count
- condition index
- risk level

Use these risk colors:

GREEN = Normal
YELLOW = Waspada
ORANGE = Warning
RED = Critical

Requirements:

1. Interactive map
2. Transformer markers
3. Marker clustering when appropriate
4. Filter by risk level
5. Filter by feeder
6. Search transformer
7. Click marker
8. Show transformer detail panel
9. Show condition index
10. Show AI status

When a transformer is selected, show:

Transformer ID
Capacity
Loading
Temperature
Power Factor
Age
Outages
Condition Index
Risk Level
Recommended Action

Clearly label the AI result as DEMO until a real validated ANFIS model is connected.

Test the GIS in the browser.
PROMPT 3 â€” Database
Kemudian:

Implement the PostgreSQL + PostGIS database architecture.

Create tables:

transformers
outages
maintenance_history
work_orders
model_predictions

The transformers table must include:

id
asset_code
name
substation
feeder
region
capacity_kva
commissioning_year
latitude
longitude
geom
loading_pct
overload_duration_h
temperature_c
voltage_deviation_pct
power_factor
outages_12m
trips_12m
maintenance_score
last_maintenance_days
oil_test_score
condition_index
risk_level
failure_history
failure_12m
updated_at

Use:

PostGIS geometry(Point, 4326)

Create spatial indexes.

Create database migrations/schema.

Create seed data using DEMO DATA only.

Do not hard-code production credentials.
Use environment variables.

Verify database connectivity.
PROMPT 4 â€” Excel â†’ Database
Setelah itu:

Create an Excel/CSV import pipeline.

The source dataset will follow this structure:

ID_Trafo
Nama_Trafo
Gardu
Penyulang
Wilayah
Latitude
Longitude
Kapasitas_kVA
Tahun_Operasi
Umur_Tahun
Tegangan_Primer_kV
Tegangan_Sekunder_V
Arus_Aktual_A
Beban_kVA
Loading_pct
Overload_Duration_h
Temperature_C
Voltage_Deviation_pct
Power_Factor
Gangguan_12Bln
Trip_12Bln
Maintenance_Score
Last_Maintenance_Days
Oil_Test_Score
Condition_Index
Risk_Level
Failure_History
Failure_12Bln
Catatan

Build:

1. File validation
2. Missing value detection
3. Data type validation
4. Coordinate validation
5. Duplicate transformer detection
6. Unit validation
7. Import preview
8. Import to PostgreSQL/PostGIS

Do not automatically modify suspicious engineering data.
Flag it for review instead.
PROMPT 5 â€” ANFIS
Ini baru kita jalankan setelah Excel yang tadi Anda isi sudah tersedia.

Implement the machine learning pipeline for transformer condition assessment.

Use the transformer dataset as the source.

Candidate features:

Loading_pct
Overload_Duration_h
Temperature_C
Voltage_Deviation_pct
Power_Factor
Gangguan_12Bln
Trip_12Bln
Maintenance_Score
Last_Maintenance_Days
Oil_Test_Score
Umur_Tahun

Target:

Condition_Index

Build:

1. Data cleaning
2. Missing value analysis
3. Outlier analysis
4. Feature scaling
5. Train/test split
6. ANFIS model
7. Hyperparameter tuning
8. Training
9. Validation
10. Test evaluation
11. Model persistence
12. Model versioning

Compare ANFIS against at least:
- Random Forest
- XGBoost or Gradient Boosting
- MLP neural network

Report:
MAE
RMSE
R2

Do NOT fabricate accuracy.

If the dataset is too small, explicitly report that the model is not ready for operational deployment.

Create an API endpoint:

POST /api/predict/transformer

Return:

condition_index
risk_level
model_version
prediction_timestamp

Do not present the result as an engineering diagnosis.
PROMPT 6 â€” Hubungkan AI ke GIS
Ini bagian yang akan membuat showcase-nya menarik:

Connect the validated transformer condition model to the GIS dashboard.

For each transformer:

1. Retrieve latest operational data.
2. Run the ML prediction.
3. Store prediction in model_predictions.
4. Update dashboard condition index.
5. Update risk level.
6. Update GIS marker color.

Create a transformer detail panel with:

CONDITION INDEX
RISK
MODEL VERSION
TOP CONTRIBUTING FACTORS
RECOMMENDED ACTION

Create a ranked maintenance priority list.

Priority:
P1 = Critical
P2 = High
P3 = Medium
P4 = Low

Allow users to click a transformer in the priority table and automatically zoom the GIS map to that transformer.
Hasil akhirnya
Kita akan mempunyai aplikasi seperti:

Landing

â†’ Dashboard

â†’ GIS

â†’ pilih trafo

â†’ AI Assessment

â†’ Condition Index

â†’ Risk

â†’ Maintenance Priority

Jadi saat dipresentasikan kepada manajemen, alurnya sangat mudah:

"Di mana aset yang bermasalah?"

GIS menjawab.

"Seberapa sehat aset tersebut?"

ANFIS menjawab.

"Mengapa nilainya turun?"

Feature analysis menjawab.

"Mana yang harus ditangani dulu?"

Priority ranking menjawab.

"Apa dampaknya terhadap reliability?"

Reliability dashboard menjawab.

Catatan penting untuk PLN
Untuk tahap showcase kita boleh menggunakan data demo. Jangan memasukkan data operasional atau data internal PLN ke layanan AI eksternal tanpa memastikan kebijakan keamanan/data PLN mengizinkannya. Antigravity saat ini juga memiliki jalur enterprise melalui Gemini Enterprise/Google Cloud dengan kontrol IAM dan VPC Service Controls, jadi deployment internal sebaiknya kita bahas terpisah ketika prototype sudah matang. 

Langkah kita sekarang: buka Antigravity, buat workspace baru bernama BDIS-Bengkayang, lalu jalankan PROMPT 1. Setelah Antigravity menghasilkan aplikasinya, kirim screenshot atau hasil/artifact-nya ke saya. Saya akan bantu mengoreksi desain dan memberikan PROMPT 2 yang sudah disesuaikan dengan hasil aktualnya. 
